        {"id": "85-defense", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 164, "line_end": 164, "quote": "黛玉道：“你骂她作什么？地湿了擦干就是。一个人若能同时在厨房取碗，又在这里端水，倒该请她教教我们。”"},
        {"id": "85-two-stacks", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 166, "line_end": 166, "quote": "一叠纸色新旧不一，几张上头各有小题，最上另压着一张总题，写着“十独吟”三字；另一叠却零乱些，有的只写了几行。"},
        {"id": "85-draft-clipped", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 250, "line_end": 250, "quote": "雪雁便照旧夹回那本旧集。"},
        {"id": "85-current-new-formula", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 252, "line_end": 252, "quote": "紫鹃犹豫道：“今儿才照新方吃第二日。大夫说过，有起有落。若今夜还这样，明儿一早就去。”"},
        {"id": "85-later-wakes", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 266, "line_end": 266, "quote": "这一夜，黛玉后来又醒了两次，一次要水，一次只问了声什么时辰。"}
