        {"id": "86-actual-writing", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 344, "line_end": 344, "quote": "黛玉不理她，在那空处试写了一个“试”字。写完看了一会，又用笔尖慢慢圈去，道：“这个也不好。”"},
        {"id": "86-old-formula-term", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 370, "line_end": 370, "quote": "大夫仍没来，只叫一个小学徒带话，说前一处病人绊住了脚，若过得来便来；若太晚，先照旧方服着。"},
