        {"id": "86-sent-out", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 382, "line_end": 382, "quote": "低声道：“你这会子就去。先回老太太、太太，说姑娘今夜很不好，请人来瞧。再打发人告诉宝二爷。别在路上哭，也别逢人就嚷，快去快回。”"},
        {"id": "86-return-and-first-report", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 390, "line_end": 390, "quote": "这一声才出口，外头恰好一阵脚步急响。雪雁先冲进来，后面跟着两个婆子、小丫头。雪雁一见紫鹃的样子，脚下一软，扶住门框。婆子忙上前看了一眼，便说：“快回老太太！”一人转身又跑了出去。"},
        {"id": "86-contrary-report-location", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 394, "line_end": 394, "quote": "雪雁哭道：“我才回到那边，正说着，便有人来报。”"},
        {"id": "86-grandmother-grief", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 400, "line_end": 400, "quote": "贾母走到床前，只看了一眼，便坐不住，哭道：“我的玉儿！”说着扑身要近前。"},
        {"id": "86-script-archive", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 418, "line_end": 418, "quote": "紫鹃接过，也不翻看，只把那薄薄的诗稿夹重新塞好，抱在怀里坐了一刻，才起身收进黛玉素日放诗稿的小匣中，却没有上锁。"},
        {"id": "86-cold-bowl", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-0340e7c4723a6dcac2a5b602.txt", "line_start": 420, "line_end": 420, "quote": "窗纸渐渐发白，竹影也慢慢现出来。那盏药早已冷透，再没有人去温。"}
